#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:180
msgid ""
"A rule marks the download direction of the flows it matches. The switch "
"matches addresses and ports only, not domain names."
msgstr "规则为匹配流量的下载方向添加标记。交换机仅匹配地址和端口，不匹配域名。"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:241
msgid "A rule needs an address or a port, or it would mark all traffic"
msgstr "规则必须指定地址或端口，否则会标记所有流量"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:148
