msgstr "高级设置"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:177
msgid ""
"Also installs each rule on every client-facing port. This costs a classifier "
"entry per port, and small upload packets are prioritized without it."
msgstr ""
"同时在每个客户端侧端口安装规则，每个端口都会占用分类器表项。即使不启用此项，"
"上传小包也会获得优先处理。"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:151
msgid "Apply marking rules, DSCP maps and small packet priorities."
msgstr "应用标记规则、DSCP 映射和小包优先级。"

