#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:161
msgid ""
"Packets up to this IP length take the small packet priority whatever their "
"marking: ACKs, DNS, VoIP and game traffic. Keep it below a full-size "
"segment. 0 disables."
msgstr ""
"IP 包长度不超过此值时，无论其标记如何，都采用小包优先级，适用于 ACK、DNS、"
"VoIP 和游戏流量。此值应小于完整报文段的长度，设为 0 则禁用。"

