#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:144
msgid ""
"Sorts traffic into the egress queues of the switch. Marking rules put a DSCP "
"on a flow, the DSCP map turns a DSCP into a priority, and priorities 4 to 7 "
"are served ahead of the bulk band of a shaped port. The switch does all of "
"this itself, so it covers flows the PPE has offloaded. Shaper rates belong "
"to SQM."
msgstr ""
"将流量分配到交换机的出站队列。标记规则为流量设置 DSCP，DSCP 映射将其转换为优"
"先级；在启用整形的端口上，优先级 4 到 7 的队列先于普通队列组获得服务。这些处"
"理均由交换机完成，因此也适用于已由 PPE 卸载的流量。整形速率由 SQM 设置。"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:246
msgid "Source address"
msgstr "源地址"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:252
msgid "Source port"
msgstr "源端口"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:30
msgid "Telephony, voice"
msgstr "电话、语音"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:156
msgid "The DSCP map and the small packet priority stay in effect either way."
msgstr "无论是否启用此项，DSCP 映射和小包优先级都会保持生效。"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:228
msgid ""
"The DSCP to mark with, as a class name or a number from 0 to 63. It picks "
"the switch queue through the DSCP map below and the Wi-Fi access category "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"要设置的 DSCP，可填写类别名称或 0 到 63 之间的数值。它通过下方的 DSCP 映射选"
"择交换机队列，并直接决定 Wi-Fi 访问类别。"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:170
msgid ""
"The switch port the download half of each rule is installed on. Left empty, "
"it is taken from the WAN interface."
msgstr "用于安装各条规则下载方向分类器的交换机端口。留空时从 WAN 接口获取。"

#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:272
msgid "This DSCP is already mapped"
msgstr "此 DSCP 已有映射"

