#: luci-app-qca-ppe-qos/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/qca-ppe-qos.js:259
msgid ""
"What a DSCP is worth once the switch reads it, for traffic these rules mark "
"and traffic that arrives marked alike. Unlisted values stay in the bulk band."
msgstr ""
"设置交换机读取 DSCP 后采用的优先级，同时适用于由本页规则标记和到达时已带标记"
"的流量。未列出的值使用普通队列组。"

